---
title: Subagent checkouts
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant agent as Agent
  participant cli as uze agent work
  participant app as Application
  participant core as Core checkout
  participant git as Git
  agent->>cli: split parser
  cli->>app: split_work, identified by UZE_AGENT
  app->>core: acquire a slot from the pool
  core->>git: reuse a free slot, or worktree add
  core->>git: record the child and its split commit
  app-->>cli: the checkout's path
  cli-->>agent: path alone on stdout
  Note over agent: the subagent works and commits there
  agent->>cli: join parser
  cli->>app: join_work
  app->>core: refuse over uncommitted work, a paused replay, a process inside
  core->>git: rebase --onto the agent's HEAD from the split commit
  core->>git: merge --ff-only into the agent's branch
  app->>core: release the child's slot to the pool
  cli-->>agent: joined N commits, no merge commit
